#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: en/chapters/server_guide.xml:18
msgid ""
"Sphinx fulltext search allows using the <ulink "
"url=\"https://sphinxsearch.com/\">Sphinx Open Source Search Server</ulink> "
"for phpBB 3.1 search. Using Sphinx will improve the performance of searching"
" as well as indexing particularly in boards with large databases. Sphinx "
"server being both flexible and fast, provides a better alternative as a "
"search backend."
msgstr ""
"La recherche fulltext Sphinx permet d'utiliser le <ulink "
"url=\"https://sphinxsearch.com/\">serveur de recherche Open Source "
"Sphinx</ulink> pour la recherche de phpBB 3.1. L'utilisation de Sphinx "
"améliore les performances de recherche ainsi que d'indexation, en "
"particulier sur les forums disposant de grandes bases de données. Le serveur"
" Sphinx, à la fois flexible et rapide, constitue une meilleure alternative "
"comme moteur de recherche."

